{"id":"606229","name":"西红柿鸡蛋煮馍","author":"优子家的味道","authorId":"9910251","desc":"","cover":"images/606229/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"2个"},{"name":"火腿肠","amount":"1个"},{"name":"馒头","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"葱姜蒜、火腿肠切片、鸡蛋、西红柿切丁、馒头切小块。","img":"images/606229/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋打入碗中，蛋黄单独捞至馍花中。","img":"images/606229/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/606229/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"油热下入菜码炒香。","img":"images/606229/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入火腿肠翻炒均匀。","img":"images/606229/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入西红柿。","img":"images/606229/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盐、十三香、白糖。","img":"images/606229/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"酱油。","img":"images/606229/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻炒至酱状。","img":"images/606229/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入半碗清水。","img":"images/606229/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"水开后撒入蛋清。","img":"images/606229/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煮至蛋清定型。","img":"images/606229/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"下入提前拌好的馍花。","img":"images/606229/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"大火翻炒一至两分钟。","img":"images/606229/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入味精，翻炒均匀即可。","img":"images/606229/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"最后撒上香菜。","img":"images/606229/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"色香味俱全，营养丰富，老少皆宜。","img":"images/606229/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"西红柿炒至酱状再倒水，这样的汤汁味道更浓郁。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}